<%/* A block tagged as a visual that Prelude couldn't read, shown as the
     agent wrote it with why: a copy of the app's
     server/views/_visual-unread.eta for a plan's session (see _message.eta
     here). Keep it in step with that one. `it` has tag, code and why. */%>
<figure class="stack gap-1">
  <div class="prose"><pre><code><%= '```' + it.tag + '\n' + it.code + '\n```' %></code></pre></div>
  <figcaption class="muted">Not drawn: <%~ it.why %></figcaption>
</figure>
